Derived from the author's private Agent Platform Next (its Sensei bridge:
bridge daemon, agent command, sandboxed launcher, advisor prompt and their
tests). The copied code was adapted; private paths, hosts, model presets and
setup-specific parts were removed. No data from that project is included.

Design ideas (no code) from crew (MIT), pi-blanche (MIT), pi-meta-harness (MIT),
codex-plugin-cc (Apache-2.0), steipete/oracle (MIT) and Anthropic's advisor tool.

Depends on: aqt-spec (Apache-2.0), cryptography (Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause).
Runs as external programs (not included, not linked): bubblewrap
(LGPL-2.0-or-later), tmux (ISC), Herdr (Apache-2.0).
